=== behavior automatic
[colorpicker automatic] no spring-loadable point
  NSColorWell PlatformColorWell responds springLoadingEntered: false, conforms NSSpringLoadingDestination: false
=== behavior enabled
[colorpicker enabled] no spring-loadable point
  NSColorWell PlatformColorWell responds springLoadingEntered: false, conforms NSSpringLoadingDestination: false
=== behavior disabled
[colorpicker disabled] no spring-loadable point
  NSColorWell PlatformColorWell responds springLoadingEntered: false, conforms NSSpringLoadingDestination: false
